# Copy this file to `.env` and fill in values as needed. `.env` is gitignored.
#
# Astro convention: variables prefixed with PUBLIC_ are exposed to client-side
# code; everything else is build/server-time only.
# Docs: https://docs.astro.build/en/guides/environment-variables/
#
# There are no required variables yet. The one currently wired up is optional:
#
# Canonical site URL (sitemap + canonical/OG tags). Leave unset locally to use
# the default in astro.config.mjs. Set this on preview deploys to their URL.
# SITE_URL="https://www.city2citychurch.com"
